    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01356",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "可是他知道自己生病的根源。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But he knew the root of his illness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01356",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "因为他对自己感到羞耻的同时，又对他们感到恐惧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Because even as he felt ashamed of himself, he was also afraid of them.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01356",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "恐惧他们——恐惧他所蔑视的社会！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Afraid of them - afraid of the society he despised!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
